srem2: x % 2, for x from -999 to 999, with the sign of x. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-18, with x in cell 90 and a scratch cell t0 in cell 91.
Copy cells 10-18 to where the program needs x % 2, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x and each 91 to a free cell; the program goes on with x % 2 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator and t0; x is kept.
Size 10 cells (9 instructions and t0). It runs 9 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

cell  contents   notes
 10     190      CLA 90   cells 10-15: 5x; its last digit (5 when x is odd, 0 when even) kept, times 100, by SFT 31
 11     290      ADD 90
 12     290      ADD 90
 13     290      ADD 90
 14     290      ADD 90
 15     431      SFT 31
 16     691      STO 91   cells 16-18: doubled and divided by 1000
 17     291      ADD 91
 18     403      SFT 03
 90     000      data: x, the program's cell, which is kept
 91     000      data: t0, scratch
